{"ref":"BDB, עֲנָוָה","hw":"עֲנָוָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֲנָוָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. humility</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:33\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.33\">Pr 15:33</a> + 3 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">עַנְוָה־</span> (contr. because of Maqqeph, see Br<sup>MP</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:5\" href=\"/Psalms.45.5\">ψ 45:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עַנְוָֽתְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:36\" href=\"/Psalms.18.36\">ψ 18:36</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲנֹתְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:36\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.36\">2 S 22:36</a> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עָנָה\" href=\"/BDB,_עָנָה\", dir=\"rtl\">I</a>. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עָנָה\" href=\"/BDB,_עָנָה\", dir=\"rtl\">ענה</a>; read <span dir=\"rtl\">עֶזְרָֽתְךְ</span> Ol We);—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>humility, meekness</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:5\" href=\"/Psalms.45.5\">ψ 45:5</a> (dub.), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:33\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.33\">Pr 15:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.12\">18:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.4\">22:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:3\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.3\">Zp 2:3</a> (prob. gloss, v. We Now).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>condescension</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:36\" href=\"/Psalms.18.36\">ψ 18:36</a> (dub., v. supr.).","next":"BDB, עֱנוּת","prev":"BDB, עָנָו"}